globs: web-admin/**/*.tsx, web-admin/app/globals.css, web-admin/src/ui/**
alwaysApply: true
---

Apply `docs/dev/rules/cmx-design-system.md` to every web-admin UI change.

**Hard rules:**
- Use Cmx components only.
- Use theme token classes only: no Tailwind palette classes, no hex, no `dark:`.
- Use logical direction classes, and never `isRTL` ternaries for layout.
- Print roots get `data-mode="LIGHT"`.
- Every async view has loading, empty and error states.
- Feedback goes through `cmxMessage`.
- All text is EN/AR keys.
- Accessibility: names, focus, keyboard, 4.5:1 contrast.

**Before done:**
1. Run `cd web-admin && npm run check:ui`. Changed files must show 0 errors.
2. Run `npx eslint <files> --quiet`.
3. Run a design review with `/cmx-ui-design-review` (`.cursor/skills/cmx-ui-design-review/SKILL.md`).

Fixes are in §14 of the rules file. `node scripts/ui/codemod-classes.js <file> --write` rewrites palette and physical classes.
